    <chapter xml:id="homework">
      <title>Homework</title>
      <introduction>
        <p>
          Working exercises and asking questions is an important way to engage in our course content. Homework exercises will be assigned 
          bi-weekly. They will not be collected for a grade, but they will be very important in preparing for <xref ref="p-quizzes" text="custom">in-class quizzes</xref>. 
        </p>
        <p>
          Making mistakes and correcting them is a vital part of the learning process. The assigned homework exercises are designed
          to be a low-stakes opportunity for this. Start early, engage with your peers, and ask questions!
        </p>
      </introduction>
      <!-- Include homework files -->
      <xi:include href="./homework/homework-01.ptx"/>

